  "about": "Research sites worth knowing about, for the built-in web source and the access scan (references/access-scan.md). Free entries are strong starting points for web tasks. Account, subscription and institutional entries are probed only with the user's go-ahead. automation is a conservative default, not a reading of any contract: allowed = an agent may query and read; human-pace = an agent may read the pages a person would open for the task, one at a time, never crawl or export; manual-only = the agent suggests searches and the user runs them. A profile can add entries or override automation.",
